WEBVTT

1
00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:37.413
AUDITION TERBUKA UNTUK FILEM, DESA Bidadari

2
00:00:37.496 --> 00:00:38.622
Okay, terima kasih atas kerja anda.

3
00:00:38.706 --> 00:00:40.791
